DESCRIPTION:Take a nostalgic journey through the early years of childhood w
 ith our Babies & Toddlers exhibition. Featuring beautiful garments\, acces
 sories\, and treasured keepsakes\, this charming display showcases how bab
 ies and toddlers were cared for\, dressed\, and celebrated across generati
 ons. A highlight of the exhibition is a beautifully restored baby pram fro
 m the Museum’s collection\, carefully brought back to life by our dedica
 ted volunteers. Discover the stories behind these special items\, reminisc
 e about days gone by\, and share your own memories as you explore this hea
 rtwarming exhibition.
