SUMMARY:Vermillion High Showcase 2026
DESCRIPTION:What is Vermilion High? Vermilion High is a program initiated b
 y QUT’s student-run record label Vermilion Records. The program is the f
 irst of its kind in the country and offers a few talented high school musi
 cians the chance to participate in a collaborative production process with
  final-year creative arts undergraduates from QUT. For final-year QUT stud
 ents\, at the brink of emerging into their own professional careers\, they
  are able to refine their skills in the music business through production\
 , marketing\, artist liaising\, and event management\, to name just a few.
  For the Vermilion High students\, these lucky young artists gain the oppo
 rtunity to professionally record their original music at a state-of-the-ar
 t facility. It's a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity\, and the Vermilion High
  program empowers these emerging artists to showcase their talent to the r
 eal world. The artists performing include: Evie May Braden Judge Sophie Ni
 cholls Kira Green Liv Welsh Sabrina Rees Seb Tyne Prom In The Woods Glass 
 Rain Ethan Dahl Asher Iyer Ruby Elizabeth [button link="https://pay.qut.ed
 u.au/FCIEDUSJCONFERENECES/booking?UDS_ACTION=S1I&UDS_ACTION_DATA=FVxWcjdAX
 QROXVECNEJDBS1SQnRBXUQbVTJALARBUDEBRllS"] Tickets[/button] Vermilion Recor
 ds - https://www.instagram.com/vermilion.records?utm_source=ig_web_button_
 share_sheet&igsi=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw== Vermilion High - https://www.instagram.c
 om/vermilion.high?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&igsi=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw
 ==
