SUMMARY:The Box Show
DESCRIPTION:You'll never look at a cardboard box the same way again! Prepar
 e to have your minds blown! Four quirky misfits turn everyday junk – whe
 elie bins\, kitchen scraps\, plastic bags – into an electrifying symphon
 y of beats\, rhythm and creativity. This high-energy adventure transforms 
 trash into treasure with explosive drumming\, dance and laugh-out-loud com
 edy. An abandoned kitchen becomes a drum set\, plastic bags turn into inst
 ruments and the human body becomes a sound machine! It's a thrilling celeb
 ration of rhythm\, imagination and sustainability for all ages. Speaking i
 n 'Rhythmish' – a playful language made of rhythm and gibberish – this
  show will hook you from start to finish! Join these musical misfits who r
 einvigorate forgotten junk. Awards Winner – Critic's Pick Award – Sydn
 ey Fringe (2018) Weekly Winner – Best of Kids and Family – Adelaide Fr
 inge (2025) Weekly Winner – Best of Kids and Family – Adelaide Fringe 
 (2026)
LOCATION:South Bank Parklands\, Grey St\, South Bank
