SUMMARY:Dinos Alive: An Immersive Experience in Brisbane
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Dinos Alive is a dinosaur exhibition featuring life-size an
 imated replicas in an immersive Jurassic venue. Walk alongside the massive
  creatures that roamed our world millions of years ago! 👉 For education
 al groups (10+ people)\, other large groups (25+ people) or private corpor
 ate events please book here (you can book now and pay later). For birthday
 s (7+ people)\, you can directly buy your tickets here Highlights 🌲 Tra
 vel back to the Jurassic in a thematic park full of realistic dinosaurs—
 see these magnificent creatures in their natural habitat! 🦕 Come face t
 o face with +40 specimens of moving replicas: T-rex\, Stegosaurus\, Ankylo
 saurus\, Velociraptors\, and many more 🦈 Dive into the depths of the se
 as and interact with Jurassic sea giants in a unique virtual aquarium 😮
  Learn more about the Triassic\, Jurassic and Cretaceous periods in a fun 
 and interactive way 👓 Immerse yourself to the fullest with a captivatin
 g VR experience (for an additional fee) 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Kids can
  enjoy a “Budding Experts” interactive space\, where they can become p
 alaeontologists and tame the most iconic dinosaurs 🎁 Gift memories to s
 omeone special! Purchase a gift card for Dinos Alive: An Immersive Experie
 nce here General Info 📅 Dates and times: select your date & time direct
 ly in the ticket selector ⏳ Duration: approx. 45-75 minutes 📍 Locatio
 n: Fever Skygate | Exhibition and Experience Centre\, 30-34 The Circuit\, 
 Skygate\, Brisbane Airport 👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome! Chi
 ldren under 3 enter free of charge ♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelch
 air accessible ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience here 💳 
 ️ Please note we are a cashless venue 🦖 Dinosaurs You’ll Meet at Di
 nos Alive T-Rex Stegosaurus Ankylosaurus Parasaurolophus Pachycephalosauru
 s Suchomimus Velociraptor Among many others! Click here to see pictures an
 d read some fun facts about all these species! Description Go back million
 s of years to a land ruled by giants! This immersive experience in Brisban
 e brings you face-to-face with the fearsome and spectacular dinosaurs that
  dominated the animal world for 140 million years. From the turkey-sized V
 elociraptors to the mighty T-Rex\, interact with life-sized\, moving anima
 tronics of a large variety of species\, and see these magnificent creature
 s in their natural Jurassic habitat. Step into another world and learn som
 ething new in an experience that's fun for the whole family! Get your tick
 ets now for Dinos Alive in Brisbane!
LOCATION:Fever Skygate | Exhibition and Immersive Experience centre
URL:https://feverup.com/m/603530
