SUMMARY:Dinos Alive: An Immersive Experience in Brisbane
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Dinos Alive is a dinosaur exhibition featuring life-size an
 imated replicas in an immersive Jurassic venue. Walk alongside the massive
  creatures that roamed our world millions of years ago! 👉 For education
 al groups (10+ people)\, other large groups (25+ people) or private corpor
 ate events please book here (you can book now and pay later). For birthday
 s (7+ people)\, you can directly buy your tickets here Highlights 🌲 Tra
 vel back to the Jurassic in a thematic park full of realistic dinosaurs—
 see these magnificent creatures in their natural habitat! 🦕 Come face t
 o face with +40 specimens of moving replicas: T-rex\, Stegosaurus\, Ankylo
 saurus\, Velociraptors\, and many more 🦈 Dive into the depths of the se
 as and interact with Jurassic sea giants in a unique virtual aquarium 😮
  Learn more about the Triassic\, Jurassic and Cretaceous periods in a fun 
 and interactive way 👓 Immerse yourself to the fullest with a captivatin
 g VR experience (for an additional fee) 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Kids can
  enjoy a “Budding Experts” interactive space\, where they can become p
 alaeontologists and tame the most iconic dinosaurs General Info 🎁 Gift 
 memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card here 📅 Dates and time
 s: select your date & time directly in the ticket selector ⏳ Duration: a
 pprox. 45-75 minutes 📍 Location: Fever Skygate | Exhibition and Experie
 nce Centre\, 30-34 The Circuit\, Skygate\, Brisbane Airport 👤 Age requi
 rement: all ages are welcome! Children under 3 enter free of charge ♿ Ac
 cessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible ❓ Please consult the FAQ
 s of this experience here 💳 ️ Please note we are a cashless venue �
 � Dinosaurs You’ll Meet at Dinos Alive T-Rex Stegosaurus Ankylosaurus 
 Parasaurolophus Pachycephalosaurus Suchomimus Velociraptor Among many othe
 rs! Click here to see pictures and read some fun facts about all these spe
 cies! Description Go back millions of years to a land ruled by giants! Thi
 s immersive experience in Brisbane brings you face-to-face with the fearso
 me and spectacular dinosaurs that dominated the animal world for 140 milli
 on years. From the turkey-sized Velociraptors to the mighty T-Rex\, intera
 ct with life-sized\, moving animatronics of a large variety of species\, a
 nd see these magnificent creatures in their natural Jurassic habitat. Step
  into another world and learn something new in an experience that's fun fo
 r the whole family! Get your tickets now for Dinos Alive in Brisbane!
LOCATION:Fever Skygate | Exhibition and Immersive Experience centre\, 30-34
  The Circuit\, Skygate Home and Life Centre\, Brisbane Airport
URL:https://feverup.com/m/603530
