UID:brisbane-1wm68zx@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260923T093000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260923T113000
SUMMARY:Dinos Alive: An Immersive Experience - Birthday
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Dinos Alive is a dinosaur exhibition featuring life-size an
 imated replicas in an immersive Jurassic venue. Walk alongside the massive
  creatures that roamed our world millions of years ago! Tickets for Birthd
 ay Celebrations at Dinos Alive 🎫 Birthday ticket - includes entry to th
 e experience and birthday room for the celebration 🎫 VIP Birthday ticke
 t - includes entry to the experience and birthday room for the celebration
 \, virtual reality and a Dinos Alive poster * Please always select the 'Bi
 rthday Room' option when booking so that we can ensure that the room is re
 served exclusively for your celebration. ** A minimum of 7 tickets require
 d for a birthday booking. Highlights 🌲 Travel back to the Jurassic in a
  thematic park full of realistic dinosaurs—see these magnificent creatur
 es in their natural habitat! 🦕 Come face to face with 40+ specimens of 
 moving replicas: T-rex\, Stegosaurus\, Ankylosaurus\, Velociraptors\, and 
 many more 🦈 Dive into the depths of the seas and interact with Jurassic
  sea giants in a unique virtual aquarium 😮 Learn more about the Triassi
 c\, Jurassic and Cretaceous periods in a fun and interactive way 👓 Imme
 rse yourself to the fullest with a captivating VR experience (for an addit
 ional fee) 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Kids can enjoy a “Budding Experts
 ” interactive space\, where they can become palaeontologists and tame th
 e most iconic dinosaurs General Info 📅 Dates and times: select your dat
 e & time directly in the ticket selector ⏳ Duration: approx. 60-90 minut
 es. You will have the room booked for you for 30 minutes 📍 Location: Fe
 ver Skygate | Exhibition and Experience Centre\, 30-34 The Circuit\, Skyga
 te\, Brisbane Airport 👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome! ♿ Acce
 ssibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible ❓ Please consult the FAQs 
 of this experience here ❓ Please contact us at dinos.brisbane@exhibition
 hub.com if you have any questions Birthday Celebrations ⏳ You will have 
 access to the Birthday Room for 30 minutes 🎂 2 soft drinks per guest ar
 e included in the birthday package 👥 Please note that any person enteri
 ng the exhibition or the birthday room needs a valid ticket 👥 If you ar
 e unsure about the number of attendees\, please select the minimum\; you c
 an add more attendees upon arrival ⚠ Tickets are not refundable Descript
 ion Go back millions of years to a land ruled by giants! This immersive ex
 perience in Brisbane brings you face-to-face with the fearsome and spectac
 ular dinosaurs that dominated the animal world for 140 million years. From
  the turkey-sized Velociraptors to the mighty T-Rex\, interact with life-s
 ized\, moving animatronics of a large variety of species\, and see these m
 agnificent creatures in their natural Jurassic habitat. Step into another 
 world and learn something new in an experience that's fun for the whole fa
 mily! Get your tickets now to celebrate your birthday with us!
LOCATION:Fever Skygate | Exhibition and Immersive Experience centre\, 30-34
  The Circuit\, Skygate Home and Life Centre\, Brisbane Airport
URL:https://feverup.com/m/636771
END:VEVENT
